#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# WHAT IT IS, AND WHY IT IS NOT CI
#
# A build server treats a red check as an error to be fixed.  This loop
# treats it as an object to be computed, on the authority of Delta 15
# T15.81 (`NaturalMachine.StructuredDefect`, checked):
#
#     a representation map either transports everything, or at least one
#     of its homotopy fibers is noncontractible or empty.
#
# C15.82: *every failed equivalence contains a precise reconstruction
# question in its fibers.*  So there is no "failure" outcome here.  A
